# 📚 SmartDocAI – Local PDF Question Answering Chatbot using RAG and Ollama

SmartDocAI is a local PDF Question Answering application built using **Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)**, Python, Streamlit, Ollama, and ChromaDB.

It allows users to upload PDF documents and ask questions based on their content. The application retrieves relevant information from the uploaded PDF and generates answers using a locally running Large Language Model (LLM).

## 🚀 Features

- Upload PDF documents through a simple Streamlit interface.
- Extract text from PDF files.
- Split extracted text into smaller chunks.
- Generate text embeddings using Ollama.
- Store embeddings in ChromaDB.
- Retrieve the most relevant document chunks.
- Generate answers using the Llama 3.2 model.
- Display source page numbers for answers.
- Maintain chat history during the session.
- Run AI models locally using Ollama.

