## ⚠️ Limitations

- The current PDF extraction implementation supports readable text-based PDFs.
- Scanned or image-only PDFs are not supported by the current text extraction workflow.
- Only the currently uploaded PDF is indexed; indexing another PDF rebuilds the existing ChromaDB collection.
- Ollama must be installed and running locally.
- AI answers depend on the information retrieved from the uploaded PDF.

